# Legacy Type Names Mapping

When legacy terms are used, interpret them as the modern Overpower types:

- energy → Energy
- fighting → Combat
- strength → Brute Force
- intellect → Intelligence

These may be used interchangeably in issues, code comments, migrations, and tests.
